IMPORTANT DEVELOPMENT RULES\
\uc0\u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \u9473 \
Before creating a new page, first examine the existing components and reuse them.\
Do not create a completely new visual style for each page.\
Every new page must look like it belongs to the same RREstate product.\
When you create a new component, ask:\
"Does this look like it belongs in the reference design?"\
If not, redesign it.\
Do not blindly follow generic SaaS UI patterns.\
Do not make every section a card.\
Use whitespace and hierarchy instead.\
Keep the interface simple.\
The user should never feel overwhelmed by financial information.\
